+# Cognitum C15 T3 P2Y — durable incremental volumetric journal
+
+- Built from the frozen P2X checkpoint. This is a separate experimental Cognitum adapter; R1 and Lu are unchanged.
+- `cognitum/spatial_durable_incremental_volume.py`: host-anchored HMAC record chain with external authority CAS, fsync persistence, full-replay verified restart recovery, revocation/epoch isolation, fail-closed unanchored tail handling.
+- `proto/cognitum/spatial/v1/durable_incremental_volume.proto` + pinned Python binding: typed anchor and immutable record format.
+- The authority in the unit tests is **simulated**. No real host/trust store/OS restart is certified. No camera evidence gains physical-world authority.
+- Focused tests: `PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest -q tests/test_c15_t3_p2y_durable_incremental_volume.py`.
+- Independent wire checks: `PYTHONPATH=. python tools/verify_protobuf_schemas.py --require`.
+- Profile: `PYTHONPATH=. python tools/run_c15_t3_p2y_profile.py --out /tmp/p2y.json --rounds 5`.
+- Security/performance caveats and required external host contract: `docs/components/spatial/P2Y-durable-restart-journal.md`.
